Description: Thoth node — local-first sensor daemon (whispy SDK + thoth CLI)
 Turns this machine into a Thoth node: sensors, models, automations,
 local API + dashboard, and an outbound channel to Brain.
 The postinst script installs whispy + thoth-node for the calling user.
